<title>USA: Ocean Reef retains investment bank for Best merger.</title>
<headline>Ocean Reef retains investment bank for Best merger.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean Reef Management Inc said on Friday it has engaged Strategica Group, a merchant and investment banking firm, to coordinate all investment banking activities related to the friendly merger with Best Products Co Inc.</p>
<p>Ocean Reef is a recently founded private investment company headed by Rachmil Lekach, chairman and chief executive. Ocean Reef recently acquired the controlling interest in L. Luria &amp; Son Inc.</p>
</text>
